1
00:00:00,855 --> 00:00:02,726
This video is for procurement.

2
00:00:02,726 --> 00:00:09,835
You will learn how to prepare requests, send them in shipments, fix a mistake, and manage boxes and custody tools.

3
00:00:10,287 --> 00:00:17,107
Sign in with your name and password. Your account shows only your department: dental or dermatology.

4
00:00:17,557 --> 00:00:22,760
The Requests page shows all requests. The chips at the top filter by stage:

5
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:28,033
with the doctor, ready to prepare, in preparation, partially sent, and more.

6
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:30,877
You can also filter by branch, or search.

7
00:00:31,327 --> 00:00:36,408
Open a request that is ready. You see each item with the quantity the doctor approved.

8
00:00:36,408 --> 00:00:38,357
This is exactly what you prepare.

9
00:00:39,031 --> 00:00:44,998
Set the status of each item: preparing, waiting for the vendor, or received from the vendor.

10
00:00:44,998 --> 00:00:47,981
The request moves to In preparation by itself.

11
00:00:48,432 --> 00:00:55,011
To send, tick the items and set the quantity for this shipment. You can send part now and the rest later.

12
00:00:55,011 --> 00:00:56,452
Then tap Send shipment.

13
00:00:56,902 --> 00:01:04,702
The card shows exactly what is left. When everything is sent, the request becomes Sent, and the nurse is notified.

14
00:01:05,154 --> 00:01:10,544
Sent something by mistake? Tap Undo last step, write the reason, and confirm.

15
00:01:10,544 --> 00:01:13,624
Every undo is recorded for the quality team.

16
00:01:14,075 --> 00:01:18,685
From the request details you can print the request, or save it as PDF.

17
00:01:19,136 --> 00:01:25,108
The Boxes page shows where each doctor's box is: ready to deliver, at a branch, or empty.

18
00:01:25,108 --> 00:01:30,006
Print the QR stickers, and send the driver tasks link to the driver once.

19
00:01:30,457 --> 00:01:37,157
Need a box back? Tap Request move and choose the place. It appears in the driver's tasks right away.

20
00:01:37,608 --> 00:01:40,558
Custody is for company tools, like handpieces.

21
00:01:40,558 --> 00:01:47,228
Set the standard for each clinic, issue tools with their serial numbers, and handle broken tool reports.

22
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:53,557
Complaints shows problems reported on requests. Read them and reply in the request comments.

23
00:01:53,557 --> 00:01:55,410
The quality team closes them.

24
00:01:55,860 --> 00:02:01,190
That's it. Prepare approved requests quickly, and send what you have. Thank you!
